{"id":299,"date":"2026-02-13T20:07:37","date_gmt":"2026-02-13T20:07:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/services\/"},"modified":"2026-02-15T18:20:29","modified_gmt":"2026-02-15T18:20:29","slug":"services","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/services\/","title":{"rendered":"Services"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-bfe052b1 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-4de6aee5\"><div class=\"uagb-separator\"><\/div><h1 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Comprehensive Imaging <\/h1><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image uagb-block-259aae54 wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-7088538.jpeg ,https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-7088538.jpeg 780w, https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-7088538.jpeg 360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px\" src=\"https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-7088538.jpeg\" alt=\"Health worker examines MRI scan data in a clinical setting.\" class=\"uag-image-21\" width=\"396\" height=\"380\" title=\"services-img\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"img\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-f02a1ac0 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-1f6539c9\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image uagb-block-22bf66dd wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-7089017.jpeg ,https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-7089017.jpeg 780w, https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-7089017.jpeg 360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px\" src=\"https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-7089017.jpeg\" alt=\"A state-of-the-art MRI scanner in a well-lit hospital room, ready for patient use.\" class=\"uag-image-22\" width=\"500\" height=\"340\" title=\"services-01\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"img\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-7fc15760\"><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">01.<\/h2><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-d1bf4422\"><h3 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">MRI<\/h3><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">Our 1.5 Tesla Wide Bore MRI provides high resolution diagnostic imagines in a more spacious and comfortable environment, delivering accurate results with reduced patient anxiety.  Our registered and certified MRI Technologist are trained with the utmost patience and bedside manners.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-4e23bf70\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image uagb-block-5975b480 wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-5723875-683x1024.jpeg ,https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-5723875.jpeg 780w, https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-5723875.jpeg 360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px\" src=\"https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-5723875-683x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"Comprehensive set of brain MRI scans highlighting cranial anatomy for medical use.\" class=\"uag-image-16\" width=\"500\" height=\"340\" title=\"pexels photo 5723875\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"img\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-42b1afc3\"><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">02.<\/h2><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-2b5b97c7\"><h3 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">CT<\/h3><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">Our 64 slice CT Scan offers high-resolution images quickly and safely. Designed for precision, our facility supports timely diagnoses while minimizing radiation exposure. With expert radiologists on staff, we prioritize your health and well-being throughout the process.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-75fb60e4\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image uagb-block-dec8dc2a wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-6234596-683x1024.jpeg ,https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-6234596.jpeg 780w, https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-6234596.jpeg 360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px\" src=\"https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-6234596-683x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"Close-up of a medical practitioner using an ultrasound machine with visible hand and display.\" class=\"uag-image-23\" width=\"500\" height=\"340\" title=\"pexels photo 6234596\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"img\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-e6ec07d4\"><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">03.<\/h2><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-99c873e0\"><h3 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Ultrasound<\/h3><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">We provide high-quality ultrasound services that cater to patients of all ages. Our skilled technicians utilize advanced imaging techniques to obtain clear results, ensuring comfort and accuracy, while maintaining a focus on patient safety and care.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-69a1e017\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image uagb-block-55e41bb4 wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-4770802-683x1024.jpeg ,https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-4770802.jpeg 780w, https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-4770802.jpeg 360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px\" src=\"https:\/\/advancedhealthimg.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/02\/pexels-photo-4770802-683x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"A stylish X-ray art poster featuring a skeleton with a camera, adding an artistic touch to a minimalist interior.\" class=\"uag-image-20\" width=\"500\" height=\"340\" title=\"pexels photo 4770802\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"img\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-2d94a4af\"><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">04.<\/h2><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-0224262a\"><h3 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">X-Ray<\/h3><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">Our advanced X-ray imaging services offer quick and effective diagnostics. With cutting-edge technology and a patient-centered approach, we deliver high-quality images that help physicians make informed decisions for your health.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-847f0174\"><div class=\"uagb-separator\"><\/div><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Our Streamlined Imaging Process Explained<\/h2><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-layout-grid uagb-block-cd2486f8 alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-680c0089\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-2c1fc22f\"><p class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Initial Registration<\/p><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">We begin with a thorough and necessary registration forms for efficient and safe services.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-f6244a01\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-3e2e789f\"><p class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Imaging Procedure Preparation<\/p><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">Our team prepares you for the imaging procedure, explaining each step and ensuring your comfort and understanding throughout.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-0815f89c\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-4fdc0b6f\"><p class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Advanced Imaging Execution<\/p><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">Utilizing state-of-the-art technology, we perform the imaging procedure with precision, capturing high quality images needed for accurate diagnosis.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-77ffa57b\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-3b941aaf\"><p class=\"uagb-heading-text\">Report Review and Portal Access<\/p><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">Once exam is completed, results are reviewed by our board certified Radiologists. Patients and physicians are given portal access to view images and reports easily.<\/p><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Comprehensive Imaging 01. MRI Our 1.5 Tesla Wide Bore MRI provides high resolution diagnostic imagines in a more spacious and [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_med